  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop for Nature-based Solutions for coastal protection in Petite C&#xf4;te, Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity promotes the use of Nature-based Solutions (NbS) for coastal protection in Senegal, where projects often rely on grey infrastructure despite growing coastal risks. The initiative aims to strengthen knowledge and practical application of NbS by sharing Dutch expertise.The Netherlands embassy in Dakar will organise a workshop along the Petit C&#xf4;te near Dakar, bringing together Senegalese decision makers, regional organisations and Dutch NbS experts. Through site visits and technical sessions, the programme will build capacity on NbS and provide input to the scoping of a proposed &#x20ac;75 million coastal protection project.</narrative>
  </description>
